00:01:26.820 --> 00:01:32.320
must achieve automotive level repeatability while remaining far cheaper per unit than current

00:01:32.320 --> 00:01:38.220
industrial robots. Physics and economics both push toward vertical integration of motors,

00:01:38.620 --> 00:01:44.720
gearboxes, and control electronics inside the same site. The same pattern Tesla applied to battery

00:01:44.720 --> 00:01:50.880
