00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:56.300
structural cost advantage that outside robot makers cannot easily match without similar scale.

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:02.140
Future Optimus pricing and availability will be set by manufacturing throughput rather than

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:08.420
by software breakthroughs alone. Tesla executives confirm the second generation roadster will be built

00:02:08.420 --> 00:02:14.100
at Giga Factory Texas. Planning for the production layout has begun the first concrete statement

